# terraform / opentofu — state is committed only when SOPS-encrypted
# (tech proposal §11.3); never commit plaintext state or real tfvars.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
!terraform.tfstate.enc
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
*.tfplan
tfplan*.out
